Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Definition",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (Lower layer). The lower layers of the brain represent processed \
information, such that going from a higher layer to a lower layer must \
involve some data compression, reducing the randomness. These can be \
visualised as the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]attractor\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
points, where the connections are reinforced by the ",
 StyleBox["emotional response.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
   3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925554223379*^9}, {3.968925631851144*^9, 
   3.968925706119936*^9}, {3.968925750384704*^9, 3.968925752223277*^9}, {
   3.968925874939961*^9, 3.96892588735154*^9}, {3.968925934511079*^9, 
   3.968925955214978*^9}, {3.968925993597217*^9, 3.968925994919438*^9}, {
   3.968926043449174*^9, 3.968926120834743*^9}, {3.969177336302785*^9, 
   3.9691773373210382`*^9}, {3.9694178781497*^9, 3.969417887555483*^9}, {
   3.969417950005468*^9, 3.969418001094521*^9}, {3.969418199650055*^9, 
   3.969418201340248*^9}, 3.969458690587567*^9, {3.969588315256201*^9, 
   3.969588387804634*^9}, {3.969588453942317*^9, 3.9695884889531603`*^9}, {
   3.96958855106225*^9, 
   3.96958855106324*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bd7dfa06-4336-49e8-bff9-\
804490544389"],

Cell["\<\
So the idea is that the connections will be strengthened by an emotional \
response, increasing the weightage inside the weighted random walk. This may \
be a type of reinforcement learning.\
\>", "Subitem",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
   3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925554223379*^9}, {3.968925631851144*^9, 
